sequenceDiagram
    participant WF as Workflow Service
    participant Income as Income Service
    participant Bank as Bank Aggregator SDK
    participant EPFO as EPFO Verification SDK
    participant DB as Income DB
    participant Outbox as Transactional Outbox
    participant Kafka as Event Bus (Kafka)

    WF->>Income: Trigger income verification
    Income->>Bank: Fetch bank statements & salary
    Bank-->>Income: Salary data
    Income->>EPFO: Verify employment
    EPFO-->>Income: Employment status
    Income->>DB: Persist income verification result
    Income->>Outbox: Write event to outbox (same transaction)
    DB-->>Income: Commit success
    Income->>Kafka: Publish INCOME_VERIFIED event
    Kafka-->>WF: Event consumed
    WF-->>WF: Proceed to credit check
